rkable  The axillary nodes are sectioned into two big portions  the closest to the breast designated  proximal nodes   the other portion designated  distal nodes   Section code  B  superior margin and tumor C  inferior margin and tumor D E tumor F G rubbery area H N proximal nodes O S distal nodes Labeled with the patient s name  unit number and  lymph node  393 counts  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 8cm firm  tan nodule  Sectioning reveals multiple white nodules separated by fatty tissue  Representative sections submitted in T U  Resident  SAHA SADEGHI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FXDX  1  BREAST  LEFT MEDIAL MARGIN  INTRADUCTAL HYPERPLASIA WITH FOCAL ATYPICALITIES  O R  Resident  CHIN LEE WU  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Max L  Goodman  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Kenneth Kenji Tanabe  M D  PART A  BREAST  MEDIAL MARGIN   PART B  LEBREAST WITH AXILLARY LYMPH NODES PART C  LYMPH NODE  SENTINEL   393    report_end  , Positive.
